+# iBFS Performance Benchmark
+
+> 测试日期: 2026-05-27 | GPU: Tesla V100-SXM2-32GB | CUDA 12.8 | 编译: -arch=compute_60 -code=sm_70
+
+## 数据集
+
+| 数据集 | 顶点数 | 边数 | CSR 来源 |
+|--------|--------|------|----------|
+| cit-Patents | 3,774,768 | 33,037,895 | SNAP |
+| soc-orkut | 2,997,166 | 212,698,418 | SNAP |
+| soc-sinaweibo | 58,655,849 | 522,642,142 | SNAP (rabbit reorder) |
+| soc-twitter | 21,297,772 | 530,051,618 | SNAP |
+
+## 测试参数
